\newlabel{fig:boundary}{{2}{4}{(a) Average boundary solvability across 9 task transitions. (b) Average terminal energy at task boundaries. \hace {} variants retain $3$--$5\times $ more energy than all CRL baselines, directly enabling higher boundary solvability}{figure.caption.9}{}}
